1
00:01:57,530 --> 00:02:03,530
"Rock-a-bye, baby, on the tree top,

2
00:02:03,530 --> 00:02:06,530
When the wind blows,

3
00:02:06,530 --> 00:02:10,530
The cradle will rock.

4
00:02:10,530 --> 00:02:13,530
When the bough breaks,

5
00:02:13,530 --> 00:02:17,530
The cradle will fall,

6
00:02:17,530 --> 00:02:22,530
And down will come baby,

7
00:02:22,530 --> 00:02:39,530
Cradle and all."

8
00:02:39,530 --> 00:02:41,530
Hi, Marilyn,

9
00:02:41,530 --> 00:02:43,530
What are you doing?

10
00:02:43,530 --> 00:02:47,530
Just sketching.

11
00:02:47,530 --> 00:02:55,530
I've been thinking a lot about our responsibilities

12
00:02:55,530 --> 00:02:57,530
in the past few weeks.

13
00:02:57,530 --> 00:02:58,530
I never stop thinking about them.

14
00:02:58,530 --> 00:03:00,530
I've been wrestling

15
00:03:00,530 --> 00:03:04,530
with the question of whether I go back to work or not.

16
00:03:04,530 --> 00:03:05,530
I see.

17
00:03:05,530 --> 00:03:06,530
And I'm torn.

18
00:03:06,530 --> 00:03:08,530
I really want to go back to work,

19
00:03:08,530 --> 00:03:10,530
use my talents,

20
00:03:10,530 --> 00:03:12,530
and pursue my career in fashion design

21
00:03:12,530 --> 00:03:14,530
like we always thought I would.

22
00:03:14,530 --> 00:03:15,530
But now ...

23
00:03:15,530 --> 00:03:18,530
I want to be with Max as a full-time mother,

24
00:03:18,530 --> 00:03:20,530
especially when he's a baby.

25
00:03:20,530 --> 00:03:23,530
I really understand, Marilyn.

26
00:03:23,530 --> 00:03:25,530
But you never have to worry about Max.

27
00:03:25,530 --> 00:03:27,530
There's Mother and Grandpa ...

28
00:03:27,530 --> 00:03:29,530
and I can always arrange my photo schedule

29
00:03:29,530 --> 00:03:30,530
around your schedule,

30
00:03:30,530 --> 00:03:31,530
if that will help.

31
00:03:31,530 --> 00:03:35,530
It's not the same, Richard.

32
00:03:35,530 --> 00:03:41,530
Have you discussed going back to work with your boss?

33
00:03:41,530 --> 00:03:43,530
Rita Mae called yesterday. Rita Mae

34
00:03:43,530 --> 00:03:47,530
Ah! That's what's got you thinking, isn't it?

35
00:03:47,530 --> 00:03:48,530
She wants to know

36
00:03:48,530 --> 00:03:51,530
when I think I'll be returning to the boutique.

37
00:03:51,530 --> 00:03:52,530
And you said ... ?

38
00:03:52,530 --> 00:03:55,530
I said I'd give her an answer in a few days ...

39
00:03:55,530 --> 00:03:58,530
that I wasn't sure.

40
00:03:58,530 --> 00:04:01,530
I'm sure Rita Mae will understand

41
00:04:01,530 --> 00:04:03,530
and wait until you're ready to go back to work.

42
00:04:03,530 --> 00:04:06,930
Well, maybe she will, and maybe she won't.

43
00:04:06,930 --> 00:04:07,930
Who knows?

44
00:04:07,930 --> 00:04:10,530
If I don't accept her offer,

45
00:04:10,530 --> 00:04:13,530
maybe she'll find someone else in the meantime,

46
00:04:13,530 --> 00:04:14,530
and when I'm ready to go back,

47
00:04:14,530 --> 00:04:15,530
there won't be a job for me.

48
00:04:15,530 --> 00:04:17,530
That's something to consider.

49
00:04:17,530 --> 00:04:19,530
You've got yourself to think about, too.

50
00:04:19,530 --> 00:04:22,530
But I am thinking about myself.

51
00:04:22,530 --> 00:04:23,530
Don't you see?

52
00:04:23,530 --> 00:04:24,530
What do you mean?

53
00:04:24,530 --> 00:04:26,530
It's not just the job.

54
00:04:26,530 --> 00:04:34,530
It's also my career as Max's mother.

55
00:04:34,530 --> 00:04:37,530
That's the way I look at it.

56
00:04:37,530 --> 00:04:41,530
I have two career opportunities at the same time.

57
00:04:41,530 --> 00:04:43,530
My career as a fashion designer

58
00:04:43,530 --> 00:04:44,530
and my career as a mother.

59
00:04:44,530 --> 00:04:50,530
I never really thought about being a mother as a career.

60
00:04:50,530 --> 00:04:54,530
I guess you do have two career opportunities

61
00:04:54,530 --> 00:04:57,530
and a decision to make.

62
00:04:57,530 --> 00:05:01,530
I hear Max.

63
00:05:01,530 --> 00:05:04,530
I'll do it.
